    "body": "## Summary\n- wire `approvedExpenseAmount` through the admin dispute API client\n- add an explicit expense adjudication control to the admin dispute resolution form\n- preserve backward-compatible default settlement semantics when no exact amount is selected\n- block expense adjudication entirely for `RESUME_JOB`\n- validate non-negative PLN amounts with cent precision before submission\n- explain that any unapproved part of the expense budget returns to the requester\n\n## Why\n#111 made labor compensation and receipt-backed expense reimbursement independently adjudicable in the backend. Without an admin UI, that production capability was not operationally usable. This slice exposes it without changing the existing default behavior for disputes that do not need partial expense decisions.\n\n## Migration\nNo Flyway migration is required; this consumes the API contract introduced by #111.\n\n## Validation\nDo not merge until every required latest-head workflow/check is complete and green.",
